OL,3,GNEWSAFestivalgoers asked not to flush
OL,4,Acamp chairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FFestivalgoers are being urged to think
OL,7,Fbefore they flush to help keep toilets
OL,8,Fworking throughout a busy weekend.
OL,10,FPeople heading to Reading Festival are
OL,11,Fbeing asked to stick to the "three Ps"
OL,12,Fby only flushing toilet paper, pee and
OL,13,Fpoo - down the loos; and using bins for
OL,14,Feverything else.
OL,16,FThames Water said workers found
OL,17,Feverything from wet wipes and clothing
OL,18,Fto tents and camping chairs in festival
OL,19,Ftoilets last year, as revellers dumped
OL,20,Fenough wastewater to fill about half an
OL,21,FOlympic-sized swimming pool.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
